# The whole repo is the Docker build context for scripts/docker/*.Dockerfile,
# and the images only need the Dockerfile itself — everything sent here is
# copied to the Docker daemon on every build. Without this, ~40MB of .git,
# ~15MB of assets and any multi-GB ISO in out/ were shipped each time.
.git
.github
out
work
build
assets
docs
archiso
qml
profiles
custom-pkgs
cursors
*.iso
*.img
*.pkg.tar.*
__pycache__
*.pyc
.DS_Store
